**Vulnerable:**
```javascript
// No origin validation
app.use(cors({
  origin: true  // Allows any origin
}));
```

**Fixed:**
```javascript
// Origin validation
app.use(cors({
  origin: (origin, callback) => {
    const allowed = allowedOrigins.includes(origin);
    callback(null, allowed);
  }
}));
```

